                  "properties": {},
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "element",
                      "tagName": "h2",
                      "properties": {},
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "value": "Introduction",
                          "position": {
                            "start": {
                              "line": 9,
                              "column": 4,
                              "offset": 232
                            },
                            "end": {
                              "line": 9,
                              "column": 16,
                              "offset": 244
                            }
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "element",
                  "tagName": "p",
                  "properties": {},
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "value": "The landscape of autism research has shifted considerably over the past decade, driven in part by advocacy from autistic people themselves. ",
                      "position": {
                        "start": {
                          "line": 11,
                          "column": 1,
                          "offset": 246
                        },
                        "end": {
                          "line": 11,
                          "column": 141,
                          "offset": 386
                        }
                      }
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "element",
                      "tagName": "cite",
                      "properties": {
                        "className": [
                          "cite"
                        ],
                        "dataKeys": "Pellicano2014"
                      },
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "type": "raw",
                          "value": "(Pellicano et al., 2014)"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "value": " documented a striking divergence between researcher priorities and the lived concerns of autistic adults and their families — a finding that prompted a broader conversation about whose questions research should answer.",
                      "position": {
                        "start": {
                          "line": 11,
                          "column": 162,
                          "offset": 407
                        },
                        "end": {
                          "line": 11,
                          "column": 381,
                          "offset": 626
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  ],
                  "position": {
                    "start": {
                      "line": 11,
                      "column": 1,
                      "offset": 246
                    },
                    "end": {
                      "line": 11,
                      "column": 381,
                      "offset": 626
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "type": "element",
                  "tagName": "p",
                  "properties": {},
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "value": "Prevalence estimates have also been revised upward and the male-to-female ratio has been scrutinized more carefully. The review by ",
                      "position": {
                        "start": {
                          "line": 13,
                          "column": 1,
                          "offset": 628
                        },
                        "end": {
                          "line": 13,
                          "column": 132,
                          "offset": 759
                        }
                      }
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "element",
                      "tagName": "cite",
                      "properties": {
                        "className": [
                          "cite"
                        ],
                        "dataKeys": "Loomes2017"
                      },
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "type": "raw",
                          "value": "(Loomes et al., 2017)"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "value": " found that earlier estimates of a 4:1 ratio significantly overstated the male skew, with implications for how diagnostic criteria are applied to women and girls.",
                      "position": {
                        "start": {
                          "line": 13,
                          "column": 150,
                          "offset": 777
                        },
                        "end": {
                          "line": 13,
                          "column": 312,
                          "offset": 939
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  ],
                  "position": {
                    "start": {
                      "line": 13,
                      "column": 1,
                      "offset": 628
                    },
                    "end": {
                      "line": 13,
                      "column": 312,
                      "offset": 939
                    }
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "element",
              "tagName": "sub-section",
              "properties": {},
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "element",
                  "tagName": "sub-section-title",
                  "properties": {},
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "element",
                      "tagName": "h2",
                      "properties": {},
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "value": "Burnout and Well-Being",
                          "position": {
                            "start": {
                              "line": 15,
                              "column": 4,
                              "offset": 944
                            },
                            "end": {
                              "line": 15,
                              "column": 26,
                              "offset": 966
                            }
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "element",
                  "tagName": "p",
                  "properties": {},
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "value": "Autistic burnout — a state of chronic exhaustion and reduced functioning resulting from sustained masking and sensory overload — has received growing attention in the research literature. ",
                      "position": {
                        "start": {
                          "line": 17,
                          "column": 1,
                          "offset": 968
                        },
                        "end": {
                          "line": 17,
                          "column": 189,
                          "offset": 1156
                        }
                      }
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "element",
                      "tagName": "cite",
                      "properties": {
                        "className": [
                          "cite"
                        ],
                        "dataKeys": "Mantzalas2022"
                      },
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "type": "raw",
                          "value": "(Mantzalas et al., 2022)"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "value": " proposed a conceptual model of the risk and protective factors that contribute to burnout, drawing on both empirical work and community testimony.",
                      "position": {
                        "start": {
                          "line": 17,
                          "column": 210,
                          "offset": 1177
                        },
                        "end": {
                          "line": 17,
                          "column": 357,
                          "offset": 1324
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  ],
                  "position": {
                    "start": {
                      "line": 17,
                      "column": 1,
                      "offset": 968
                    },
                    "end": {
                      "line": 17,
                      "column": 357,
                      "offset": 1324
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "type": "element",
                  "tagName": "p",
                  "properties": {},
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "value": "Understanding the autistic experience requires moving beyond deficit-focused frameworks. ",
                      "position": {
                        "start": {
                          "line": 19,
                          "column": 1,
                          "offset": 1326
                        },
                        "end": {
                          "line": 19,
                          "column": 90,
                          "offset": 1415
                        }
                      }
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "element",
                      "tagName": "cite",
                      "properties": {
                        "className": [
                          "cite"
                        ],
                        "dataKeys": "CaldwellHarris2023"
                      },
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "type": "raw",
                          "value": "(Caldwell-Harris, 2023)"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "value": " argues for an approach grounded in insider accounts, noting that autistic self-report reveals cognitive and social patterns that purely behavioral observation misses.",
                      "position": {
                        "start": {
                          "line": 19,
                          "column": 116,
                          "offset": 1441
                        },
                        "end": {
                          "line": 19,
                          "column": 283,
                          "offset": 1608
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  ],
                  "position": {
                    "start": {
                      "line": 19,
                      "column": 1,
                      "offset": 1326
                    },
                    "end": {
                      "line": 19,
                      "column": 283,
                      "offset": 1608
                    }
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "element",
              "tagName": "sub-section",
              "properties": {},
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "element",
                  "tagName": "sub-section-title",
                  "properties": {},
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "element",
                      "tagName": "h2",
                      "properties": {},
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "value": "Education and Stigma Reduction",
                          "position": {
                            "start": {
                              "line": 21,
                              "column": 4,
                              "offset": 1613
                            },
                            "end": {
                              "line": 21,
                              "column": 34,
                              "offset": 1643
                            }
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "element",
                  "tagName": "p",
                  "properties": {},
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "value": "Reducing stigma in higher education settings has been identified as a key priority. ",
                      "position": {
                        "start": {
                          "line": 23,
                          "column": 1,
                          "offset": 1645
                        },
                        "end": {
                          "line": 23,
                          "column": 85,
                          "offset": 1729
                        }
                      }
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "element",
                      "tagName": "cite",
                      "properties": {
                        "className": [
                          "cite"
                        ],
                        "dataKeys": "GillespieLynch2017"
                      },
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "type": "raw",
                          "value": "(Gillespie-Lynch et al., 2017)"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "value": " evaluated an online training program for college students and found meaningful improvements in both knowledge and attitudes toward autistic peers.",
                      "position": {
                        "start": {
                          "line": 23,
                          "column": 111,
                          "offset": 1755
                        },
                        "end": {
                          "line": 23,
                          "column": 258,
                          "offset": 1902
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  ],
                  "position": {
                    "start": {
                      "line": 23,
                      "column": 1,
                      "offset": 1645
                    },
                    "end": {
                      "line": 23,
                      "column": 258,
                      "offset": 1902
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "type": "element",
                  "tagName": "p",
                  "properties": {},
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "value": "Multi-pronged approaches combining awareness training with structural accommodation have shown the most promise. ",
                      "position": {
                        "start": {
                          "line": 25,
                          "column": 1,
                          "offset": 1904
                        },
                        "end": {
                          "line": 25,
                          "column": 114,
                          "offset": 2017
                        }
                      }
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "element",
                      "tagName": "cite",
                      "properties": {
                        "className": [
                          "cite"
                        ],
                        "dataKeys": "Mantzalas2022,Pellicano2014"
                      },
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "type": "raw",
                          "value": "(Mantzalas et al., 2022; Pellicano et al., 2014)"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "value": " both point to the importance of community involvement in designing interventions rather than imposing them from outside.",
                      "position": {
                        "start": {
                          "line": 25,
                          "column": 151,
                          "offset": 2054
                        },
                        "end": {
                          "line": 25,
                          "column": 272,
                          "offset": 2175
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  ],
                  "position": {
                    "start": {
                      "line": 25,
                      "column": 1,
                      "offset": 1904
                    },
                    "end": {
                      "line": 25,
                      "column": 272,
                      "offset": 2175
                    }
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
